{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras/9fbd591af4d6df2e134b4ee8de06bebe.avif?t=1774321342\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras_big/9fbd591af4d6df2e134b4ee8de06bebe.avif?t=1774321342 width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Darkness in the Forest</i></strong> is a first-person horror game that places you in the heart of a dense, isolated forest. Stranded on a desolate road after your car runs out of gas, you venture into a dark forest in search of help, only to stumble upon an abandoned factory shrouded in grim secrets. But beware: a ravenous werewolf stalks the shadows, and every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras/eb38d5f7e24b2770cd643e604f779ad0.poster.avif?t=1774321342\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras/eb38d5f7e24b2770cd643e604f779ad0.webm?t=1774321342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras/eb38d5f7e24b2770cd643e604f779ad0.mp4?t=1774321342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the factory\u2019s corroded corridors, solve puzzles, gather resources to escape, and survive while unraveling the mysterious history of the old factory. With an immersive atmosphere, dynamic lighting, and chilling sounds, this 40- to 60-minute journey will test your nerves in a pulse-pounding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras/69896ea43afee7125c5609488a88b7ae.poster.avif?t=1774321342\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras/69896ea43afee7125c5609488a88b7ae.webm?t=1774321342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/extras/69896ea43afee7125c5609488a88b7ae.mp4?t=1774321342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Tense Survival:</strong> Hide from the werewolf using strategy and the environment to your advantage.<br>\u2022 <strong>Immersive Puzzles:</strong> Uncover clues and manipulate ancient machinery to progress through the abandoned factory.<br>\u2022 <strong>Deep Narrative:</strong> Discover scattered notes that reveal the creature\u2019s origins and the region\u2019s dark past.<br>\u2022 <strong>Haunting Visuals:</strong> Built with Unreal Engine 5, featuring detailed environments and lighting effects that amplify the terror.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785380?t=1774321342","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785380?t=1774321342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/77eaab33dcfc8f4ddb30cf92dd0105366181e8df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774321342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785380/77eaab33dcfc8f4ddb30cf92dd0105366181e8df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774321342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://